  "abstract": "The screen recording shows how to edit a manuscript via GitHub using Manubot. Manubot is the the manuscript bot for automated scholarly publishing. It is an open source software project for writing scholarly documents using GitHub. Learn more at https://manubot.org.This screen recording is used as a supporting data video for the manuscript describing Manubot at https://greenelab.github.io/meta-review/.This latest version of this Figshare item is available at https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.7946192 or shortened to https://doi.org/c4fz.",
